## 4. Risks and mitigations

| Risk | Current mitigation |
|---|---|
| Direct identification | Identifier columns pseudonymised (HMAC-SHA256) |
| Linkage across rounds | Same key reused; keys stored outside the repo |
| Reconstruction of small groups | Cells with n < {{ small_cell }} suppressed in reports |
| Unauthorised access | AES-GCM encryption available via `--encrypt` |

